{
  "unitID": "ismg6860_u05",
  "placeholder": false,
  "order": 5,
  "unitName": "5. Enumeration",
  "unitDescription": "This unit teaches enumeration as the disciplined step between scanning and analysis. Players query live services at Halloway Precision Manufacturing to extract names, shares, users, directory entries, mail routing, DNS records, RPC endpoints, and tunnel configuration, then turn scattered protocol evidence into one defensible finding about a vendor account nobody ever decommissioned.",
  "defaultPlayerName": "Alex",
  "unitEntryMessage": "Welcome back, {player}. Cordata Security Partners has placed you on the Halloway Precision Manufacturing engagement. After a vendor laptop touched the plant network, Halloway needs an accurate inventory of what is actually running before anyone changes a firewall rule. Dana Osei has authorized read-only enumeration across the plant. Query the services, keep the evidence clean, and find out what is really still connected.",
